## Target pattern (single source of truth)

Replace BBW handle/knot patterns with the brushes catalog form, keep `\bhuck` (Hucklaration) as a separate handle cue:

```yaml
Bristle Brushwerks:
  Unspecified:   # handles
    patterns:
      - \bhuck
      - bristle.*brush ?w[eo]rks?
# knots.yaml — same brand patterns, drop the horse-bristle negative lookbehind
```

Optional tightening (only if rematch shows misses):

```yaml
- bristle\s*brush\s*[vw]?[eo]?rks?   # Werks / Works / Werks typo space variants
- bristlebrushwerks                   # concatenated
```

Prefer one shared pattern aligned with `brushes.yaml` first; add aliases only if needed after rematch.

**Files to update (YAML — requires explicit user permission at execute time):**

- `data/handles.yaml` — Bristle Brushwerks patterns
- `data/knots.yaml` — Bristle Brushwerks patterns
- `data/handles_new_structure.yaml` — same (currently `bristle.*brush`; keep in sync or delete if unused)
- `data/correct_matches/{brush,handle,knot}.yaml` — only for residual FPs / Bruskwerks typo after pattern fix
- `data/brushes.yaml` — only if we unify pattern spelling; behavior already correct

**Files to update (code/tests — no YAML permission needed):**

- New or existing matcher tests under `tests/match/` (brush / handle / knot)
- Optionally `sotd/match/brush/strategies/utils/fiber_utils.py` (follow-up only)

